  "description": [
    "A member of the class of  guanidines that consists of guanidine carrying a methyl substituent at position 1, a cyano group at position 2 and a 2-{[(5-methyl-1<em>H</em>-imidazol-4-yl)methyl]sulfanyl}ethyl group at position 3. It is a  H<small><sub>2</sub></small>-receptor antagonist that inhibits the production of acid in stomach."
  ],
